  "visible_markdown": "## 1 Native Assignment Migration Fixture\n> **中文译文：1 Native Assignment Migration Fixture**\n**Problem (p1): Explain the update rule for the training objective.**\n> **问题（p1）： Explain the update rule for the training objective.（中文说明）**\nThe objective combines a data term with a regularization term.\n> 中文译文：The objective combines a data term with a regularization term.\n**Example (e1): Evaluate the rule when the learning rate is 0.1.**\n> **示例（e1）： Evaluate the rule when the learning rate is 0.1.（中文说明）**\n**Low-Resource Tip: Cache repeated feature vectors.**\n> **低资源提示： Cache repeated feature vectors.（中文说明）**\n- Verify every intermediate value before submission.\n> 中文译文：- Verify every intermediate value before submission.\n```text\nfor value in values:\n    total += value\n```\n![Source visual from page 1](assets/visual-p001-b008.png)\n![Source visual from page 1](assets/visual-p001-b009.png)\n> 其中 x = 2 且 y = 3\n![Source visual from page 1](assets/visual-p001-b010.png)\n![Source visual from page 1](assets/visual-p001-b012.png)\n*Figure 1: Deterministic reference curve The figure is retained once with its caption.*\n> *中文译文：Figure 1: Deterministic reference curve 中文译文：The figure is retained once with its caption.*\n",
